  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dragonfire Banquet"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet of fire and spice. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This banquet is built around fish cooked in fierce oils and red desert heat. The first breath over it stings the eyes; the first bite reminds exiles why they still live."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389334_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Riverstone Fishcakes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crisp fishcakes from river stones."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ground river fish is pressed with coarse meal and fried against hot stone until the edges crackle. It is simple, filling, and easy to trust."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389335_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Current-Smoked Ration"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Smoked ration for hard marches."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "River fish is smoked low and slow until the flesh darkens and tightens into a soldier's ration. It carries well, eats clean, and leaves the hands smelling of old campfire."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389336_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Highland Ember Cut"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mountain cut finished over embers."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This thick cut is rested near the coals until smoke and heat work into the flesh. It is the sort of meal eaten in silence after climbing too far to complain."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389337_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Royal River Portion"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A noble portion from clean current."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Selected from the finest river catch, this portion is cooked gently and dressed with clear herbs. Even in exile, some meals remember the table manners of kings."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389338_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Elder Current Feast"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A shared feast of old river ways. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Laid for a full camp, this feast follows the old river custom: first portion to the blade, second to the hand that rows, third to the one who keeps watch."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389339_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sovereign River Banquet"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet fit for river-kings. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Prepared as if for a drowned court, this banquet piles prime river fish with bright herbs and strong broth. Those who eat from it carry the current in their limbs."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389340_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Frostcamp Broth"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A warming broth for frozen camps."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fish bones and pale flesh are simmered until the broth turns rich enough to fight the cold. It is the kind of warmth a camp shares before sleep."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Cold Insulation +{0}"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389341_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
