     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_FourthModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rime-Salted Steak"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Salted fish steak with a frost edge."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A firm steak is packed in rime-salt, then seared until the outside tightens and the center stays clean. It tastes sharp enough to wake the dead from snow."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389342_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Glacierheart Soup"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A deep soup for bitter weather."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Glacier-cold fish is cooked into a thick soup with roots, fat, and patience. It settles in the chest like a banked coal beneath ice."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389343_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Aurora Prime Meal"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A prime meal bright as winter sky."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Prepared from rare northern catch, this meal is pale, clean, and strangely luminous. Exiles say it leaves the body warmer than the bowl."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389344_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Permafrost Warlord Roast"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A shared roast for frozen warbands. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This roast is carved for warriors who expect the night to be worse than the battle. Fat, smoke, and cold-water fish make it heavy enough to remember."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389345_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Leviathan Winter Banquet"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_RecipesTable_389346_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet from winter depths. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Served in great portions, this banquet carries the taste of black water beneath the ice. It is food for those who would stare down winter and make it blink first."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389346_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Blackwater Pickled Bites"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Pickled bites from black water."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Small swamp fish are pickled sharp enough to cut through mud-stink and fear. The jar smells dangerous, which is usually a good sign."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389347_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mire-Dried Field Ration"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A dried ration for mire patrols."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mire fish is dried hard, smoked lightly, and wrapped for travel through wet country. It is ugly food, but it does not betray you."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389348_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bogfire Smoked Bowl"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389349_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A smoked bowl with bogfire heat."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389349_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This bowl mixes swamp fish, dark smoke, and a low orange heat that clings to the tongue. It tastes like a campfire refusing to die in the rain."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389349_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Deepmire War Stew"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389350_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A heavy stew from deep mire."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389350_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Thick, dark, and stubborn, this stew turns mire fish into marching food. It sits heavy in the belly and steadies the hand."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389350_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ancient Mire Feast"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389351_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A shared feast from ancient mire. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389351_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Spread for those who survived the swamp's hunger, this feast carries old water, black spice, and the iron taste of endurance. No one eats it alone for long."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389351_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Abyssal King Banquet"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389352_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A mythic banquet from abyssal waters. Lasts 20 minutes when placed."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389352_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This banquet is made from deep-caught fish and dark broth, served as though to crown something below the waterline. Its richness feels less cooked than summoned."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_Fishing_ItemTable_389352_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
