    "Text": "Citizen Order"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999132_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "RecipesTable_999132_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A simple wooden chest for the town's food supplies."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999133_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Marks a household for your settlement. Assigned residents claim their own beds nearby, keep them, and return home to rest."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999134_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "General Merchant Stall"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999137_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "RecipesTable_999137_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A market stall where a merchant thrall buys raw resources for silver"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999137_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "RecipesTable_999137_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Assign a thrall to this stall and it will buy bulk raw resources - stone, wood, ore and more - for silver coins. The goods go to the town treasury."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_999137_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Founding a Town"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Founding_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Your thralls can live a life of their own. Found a town, give its people a home, and watch it come alive."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Founding_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Reach level 10"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Founding_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Training"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Training_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Strength is made, not found. Build training grounds and let your citizens grow stronger day by day."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Training_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Complete Founding a Town"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Training_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Feeding_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Gathering_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Skills_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Logistics_Prereq",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Feed the Village"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Feeding_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A village lives on its kitchen. Give your people a place to eat and food to eat there."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Feeding_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Gather Resources"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Gathering_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Turn your town into a working economy: mark resources, build workstations and let your thralls fill the stores - even while you are away."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Gathering_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Skills and Careers"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Skills_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "From hired hands to masters of their craft: let your thralls learn a trade, grow their skill and run their own shop."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Skills_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Logistics"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Logistics_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Goods do not move themselves. Set up routes between your storages and let a hauler keep the town supplied."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Logistics_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ironlight: Learning Schedules"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Schedules_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A beacon can hold more than one job. Teach your citizens a daily routine - where to stand, how long to stay, and when not to be interrupted."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_Journey_Schedules_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Lay the Foundation"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Every town starts with a heart.<br><br>Craft a Town Center and place it on open, walkable ground."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Place to Belong"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "First Hands"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Bed of Ones Own"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Lights Out"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Found_5_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grounds for Growth"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Training Beacon.<br><br>It marks where your citizens go to grow stronger."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Tools of the Trade"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Training Mat.<br><br>Other training stations work for daily training as well - but this step looks for the mat."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_2_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Into the Routine"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stronger Every Day"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Wait and watch: your thrall trains on their own and levels up Vitality.<br><br>Time and sweat do the rest."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Train_4_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Room to Rest"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Make It Yours"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Take a Seat"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Full Pantry"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Care Enabled"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_5_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bread and Salt"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_6_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stock the chest with food and watch a citizen sit down to eat.<br><br>A fed citizen is a living citizen."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Feed_6_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mark the Land"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Resource Beacon. It scans its surroundings and sets a daily cap for every resource it finds - your thralls work each resource until the cap is filled.<br><br>Do not forget: sleep and food greatly influence the daily outcome."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Place to Work"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a workstation, for example a Wood Work Place.<br><br>Workstations mark where your thralls process a resource."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_2_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hands to Work"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Assign a thrall to the Resource Beacon and give them a work schedule."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_3_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Daily Grind"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Let them work: your thralls walk out, gather and haul on their own.<br><br>Wait for the first yield to arrive in the Town Center storage."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_4_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Reap the Rewards"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_5_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While you are away, your town keeps working.<br><br>Select Get Resources in the Town Center radial menu to collect everything that was gathered offline."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Gather_5_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Career Begins"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Work Beacon. It looks for vanilla workstations nearby - your thralls can work there.<br><br>While working, their skill grows: a blacksmith needs fewer resources, crafts faster - and his shop changes with his level."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Man the Smithy"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Assign a thrall to a Work Beacon that has found a smithy."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_2_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Blacksmith, Rank One"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Let them work.<br><br>Wait until the thrall reaches Blacksmith level 1."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_3_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Shop of Their Own"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Blacksmith Stall."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_4_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Open for Business"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Skill_5_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Dispatcher's Post"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Log_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place a Logistic Beacon.<br><br>This is where a route is defined - one route per beacon."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Log_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stations on the Line"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Log_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Build and place at least 2 Logistic Stations.<br><br>Stations are where your hauler goes to work - each station reaches every storage nearby."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Log_2_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The First Route"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Log_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Place with a Purpose"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_1_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Place a Worker Beacon next to a workstation such as a Blacksmith's Bench, then give it a name of its own.<br><br>1. Place the Worker Beacon close to the bench.<br>2. Open the 'Info' UI via the radial menu.<br>3. Click the edit icon next to the name and rename it to 'Local Smithy'.<br>4. Click accept.<br><br>The name is what you will pick from every dropdown later - so name it after the place, not after the thrall standing in it."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_1_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Draft the Routine"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_2_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Open the radial menu of your beacon and select 'Open Scheduler'.<br><br>1. Click on 'Custom Routes'.<br>2. Click the '+' button in the top right corner.<br>3. Name the schedule 'Smithy'.<br>4. Select 'Smithy' in the dropdown.<br><br>A schedule is a named routine. One beacon can hold several of them."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_2_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hours at the Anvil"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_3_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Add the Blacksmith's Bench as a target and set how long the thrall should stay there - 400 for example.<br><br>The time is counted in seconds, so 400 means the thrall works at that target for 400 seconds before moving on to the next one.<br><br>This is where a routine becomes a workday: add the furnace, the anvil and whatever else belongs to the trade, and your thrall walks the round in order."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_3_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "No Time for Breaks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_4_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Deselect 'Allow Need Breaks'.<br><br>Every thrall working this schedule will now stay on the job instead of walking off to eat or sleep.<br><br>Use it where the work matters more than comfort - but remember that they still get hungry. Leave the option enabled on the schedules that follow and they will catch up on food and rest there."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_4_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Put Them to Work"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_5_Title",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Assign a thrall to the schedule in the Citizen UI.<br><br>1. Select a thrall.<br>2. Scroll down in the details to the 'Work' section and select the beacon 'Local Smithy'.<br>3. Open the dropdown and change it to 'Schedule'.<br>4. A second dropdown appears - select 'Smithy'.<br><br>Now one place can hold different routines. Build a second schedule called 'Customer' with the spots where a visitor would stand, and your smithy has a shop floor as well as a forge."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "IL_IL_Sched_5_Desc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A low divan made in the Stygian style"
