  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A carefully crafted rope made of blessed gold braided silk and fibers that are as strong as they are delicate."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991102_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Stygian Set priests are said to take the silken robes of their sacrificed victims and bath them in snake’s venom to ask the Old Serpent to bless the fabrics so that more sacrifices may be brought to the altar."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991102_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
