     "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Item_Table_77991103_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Caverns_of_Set_Recipes_Table_77919013_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Although rather unusual in the traditional Set faith, knocking out a victim at distance does have its uses. Especially, when a priest encounters a tough foe."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
