  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Irukian Column"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692026_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A column made of cut stone blocks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692026_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Columns offer stability to tall structures, allowing height to become a significant factor in building. Be aware, however, that columns also offer a unique weak point for enemies to attack.Built of close fitting bricks of cut stone reinforced blocks will provide a safe haven from the weather and strong front to any foes who come knocking."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693027_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Irukian Battlement Wall"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692027_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A low battlement wall made of cut stone blocks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692027_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This low wall battlement is not designed to keep enemies out, but rather to provide defensive archers with a measure of cover between shots. Built of close fitting bricks of cut Stonebrick, reinforced by wooden slats that have been shaped to fit, this will provide a safe haven from the weather and strong front to any foes who come knocking."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693028_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Irukian Corner Wall Trim"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692033_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A special corner wall trim made of cut stone blocks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Recipes_Table_8692033_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Laid out by the master mason, the precision cut wall corner stones anchor masonry walls in a building. These add a finished trim to the wall corners of Irukian styled architecture."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Shemite_CS_Item_Table_8693029_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
