  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ymir's Summoned"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Feat_Table_Ymirs_Respite_770124104_FeatName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A war axe imbued with the divine powers of Ymir himself."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012401_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "RecipesTable_Ymirs_Respite_770124201_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A ferocious pair of axes blessed by Ymir and carried by his elite warriors.Ymir's imbued weaponry is very deadly and they can only be carried by the most devout of followers.Dual war-axes are a difficult paired weapon for inexperienced warriors, due to their smaller surface area and uneven balance. No other dual wield weapon shares their raw power, and they can wreak havoc on unarmored foes."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_77012401_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A divine forge to craft items imbued by Ymir."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_770124101_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "It is said the gods gifted mortals items imbued with special properties to only those worthy of weilding such power."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_770124101_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Low Material Cost"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_Ymirs_Respite_770124101_FirstModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
