   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Yog is lord of the empty places: the waste beneath the sun, the black gulfs between the stars, and the hollow rooms where no kindly god will answer. His faithful kept his law in meat and moonlit blood, and were made strong by what the world cast out.</>\r\n\r\nThese boots are part of a heavy armor set worn by the faithful of Yog.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Yog's Gaze: Eating Purified Flesh grants Yog's Gaze for 10 minutes, stacking twice. If a stack is added, you are healed for 80 hitpoints. When you take damage exceeding 8% of your maximum health, one stack is consumed to reduce that hit's final damage by 60%.</>"
