  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Derketo's temples promised comfort, abandon, and the freeing of every hunger, but her acolytes knew the deeper rite. To serve the Sable Queen was to learn where breath becomes ecstasy, where ecstasy becomes offering, and where offering becomes death.</>\r\n\r\nThese anklets are part of a medium armor set worn by the faithful of Derketo.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Derketan Salacity: Spending 10 or more stamina often grants stacks of Salacity, causing your attacks to deal up to 20% bonus Astral damage and heal you accordingly. Becoming exhausted consumes Salacity and causes Backlash, making you take additional physical damage from direct attacks for 6 seconds. Salacity cannot build during Backlash.</>\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Astral magic damage sometimes causes a delayed explosion, damaging enemies in an area and granting you an absorb shield based on damage done.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "A9875C8D48F8C829F5A3DF9B4CF37D0C",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210153_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
