  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Setite Mask"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_52501_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ornate mask worn by Setite devotees."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210189_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_52501_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_RecipesTable_Add_47210189_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Gold and scale, fang and tribute: the servants of Set learned that devotion was not always hidden in shadow. Sometimes it gleamed on the skin, bright enough to invite a knife.</>\n\nThis mask is part of a light armor set worn by the faithful of Set.\n\n<LoreItalics>Blood Tribute: While wearing a Setite armor set, dealing or taking damage can consume Blood from your inventory to increase your Sanguine damage by up to 10%. Killing a human empowers your next attack with bonus Sanguine damage and Sibilant Poison.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Sanguine magic damage sometimes deals a burst of true damage based on the target's missing health, healing you if the burst kills them.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210189_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "3pc Bonus: Blood Tribute"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_52501_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
