  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Serpent-stamped Khopesh"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_51817_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_51817_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A khopesh stamped with the symbol of the serpent."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_51817_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210264_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_51817_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_RecipesTable_Add_47210264_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Set was old when men first named the stars, and his worshippers learned patience from that vast and pitiless age. To bear his arms was to practice an older cruelty: the pause before the bite, the silence before the temple doors closed.</>\n\nThis khopesh is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Set.\n\n<LoreItalics>Sibilant Poison: Your attacks often inflict a stacking Sanguine poison. The poison gains 1 stack whenever it deals damage, while repeated attacks apply progressively more stacks as it intensifies. After 20 seconds, it can no longer gain stacks or refresh its duration. Maximum 150 stacks, or 30 against players. Lasts 30 seconds and has a 30-second cooldown after ending.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Sanguine magic damage sometimes deals a burst of true damage based on the target's missing health, healing you if the burst kills them.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_51817_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210264_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
