  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A black-ice axe humming with frigid power."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210270_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_51068_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_RecipesTable_Add_47210270_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Ymir's faithful carried the north in their hands: frost on the iron, laughter in the teeth, and the courage to meet the storm face-first. Their weapons rang with the old joy of battle, bright as ice under a hard winter sun.</>\n\nThis axe is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Ymir.\n\n<LoreItalics>Cracking Glacier: Your attacks grant Frost Fracture for 12 seconds, stacking up to 10 times. Kicking consumes all Frost Fracture to deal 30 Primal cold damage per stack to enemies in a line in front of you, up to 300 damage at 10 stacks.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Primal magic damage sometimes puts a stacking damage-over-time debuff on your target that deals more Primal damage and can stack from its own damage. Each of the four elements stacks separately.</>\n\n<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_51068_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "EoT_ItemTable_Add_47210270_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
