  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fashioned from the finest alloys the Mitraen church has access to, these plates were blessed in a ritual that required constant chanting for three days and three nights while scribes engraved Mitra's deepest mysteries across them. When affixed to armor they offer ample physical protection and some protection from sorcery too."
