  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A lightweight orb filled with... something. It feels like it would be effortless to throw a great distance. Upon contact, the orb creates a steady radiant glow where it hits that lasts for a long time. Perfect for spreading Mitra's scripture to the darkest reaches of the earth."
   },
