  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fuel for your body is fuel for your wrath"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_47210126_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The Lord of Empty Abodes craves sustenance. Your sustenance. Feed this infinite appetite and your victory is assured.\n\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this causes your attacks to consume up to 30% total food to deal bonus Entropic damage when you attack for 40 seconds. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Depletes Hunger"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Boosts Attacks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210126_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Liquid flirtation with death and ecstasy"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ODO_RecipesTable_Add_47210127_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Everything you consider pleasurable is another's idea of suffering. Everything you consider unpleasant is another's secret shameful rapture.\r\n\r\n<LoreItalics>Drinking this grants you infinite stamina and causes your attacks to lifesteal for 30% of damage dealt and deal 10% bonus damage as Astral damage. While active you lose 8% of your maximum health every second. Lasts 30 seconds. 3 min cooldown shared with other infusions. Cannot be used with other religious combat consumables.</>"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Lifesteal"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ODO_ItemTable_Add_47210127_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "63B0878C4BA485DBE1F0A4AC0932D804",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "E56E8D354F0FB59F4DF480935241A071",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "7ABDCC4F47CBC8A1C9F2AD8E97AB7BE3",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "3165977644411CFD91E839B910373D21",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "185CF35B4182E5E602FF0B84D3BE8EFE",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "F799BC104170CB271E6E59A76844875E",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
