    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A simple tunic"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_6952522_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousRecipeTable_6952522_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Followers of Mitra commit to a life of simplicty and dignity. They prefer knowledge to ritual and the calm of meditation to the storm of battle.\nThis tunic reflects the simple principles of the Mitraen devout."
   },
