  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A terrifying weapon bestowed upon its wielder by a mysterious denizen of the abyss."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_43001_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A terrifying weapon formed from some unknowable material and bestowed upon its wielder by a mysterious denizen of the abyss. This weapon will vanish if the wielder perishes."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_43001_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Insatiable"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_43001_FirstModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<LoreItalics>Instinctively Conan loosened the great sword in its sheath. The pyramid on which he rested was four-sided, one - the side toward the jungle - carved in broad steps. In his hand was a Shemite bow, such as B?lit had taught her pirates to use. A heap of arrows lay at his feet, feathered ends towards him, as he rested on one knee.</> - Queen of the Black Coast\n\nCarved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants.\n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\n\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the wielder."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_24082_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_24085_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_24226_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Twin Shot"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24086_FirstModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24230_FirstModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Demonic"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24113_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow that is very light on the draw"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24137_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Easy Draw"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24137_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow covered in glowing essence"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24143_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Nightvision"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_24143_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490192_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted of bone"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This bow has been crafted from the bones of an unknown beast - the bones are strangely bendable and sturdy despite the apparent age of the bow. Whomever put this bow together prioritized sturdiness over accuracy and damage."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50527_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted from the chitinous remains of an ancient predator. "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Shaped from the sturdy but remarkably sinuous spine of the extinct Feroxodon pufferfish, this compact bow generates the same relative arrow velocity as much larger weapons. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50535_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow shaped from the hollow, adamantine bones of a winged monstrosity. "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Featherlight weaponry is highly sought after by those who count stealth as a professional virtue. The nearly weightless material is difficult to craft and even more difficult to wield as it lacks the heft and dimension associated with balanced weaponry. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50554_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow etched with a mesmerizing swirl pattern of unfathomable depth."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The swirl pattern adorning the bow length is a form of arcane barrier trapping a demon within. While the demon is unable to communicate in any way, it still hungers for killing. To the ignorant archer, the bow seems to seek an enemy's vulnerable spots almost of its own volition. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50571_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An ancient and highly-advanced bow marked with the heraldry of a long-lost empire. "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While surface details concealed within the bow's construction hint at enhanced functions lost to time, Voidforge weapons are still unmatched at their primary purpose - killing. Whichever realm is responsible for the creation of such weaponry is unknown, but the constellations hidden within the weapon's adornment are not of this world. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ripping"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_50578_FirstModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow of uncertain origin, coated in the caustic gore of the Blood Moon Beast. This overgrown specimen of Moon Beast towers above even the largest of man-sized opponents and can easily swallow one whole. The beast's innards hold a veritable treasure trove of partially digested objects and even a pristine item or two. \n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51353_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow crafted from branches"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51401_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51403_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A composite bow crafted of silk string and branches"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51402_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A finely crafted bow for hunting."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Carved from a single piece of wood, the hunting bow is used across the world and in hundreds of variants. In trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle.\n\nThis bow will be able to bring down both human and non-human foes, but it relies heavily on the skill of the archer."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51405_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow forged from an ancient design"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51406_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51407_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A light composite bow crafted of branches and thick leather."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This bow is made in the Hyrkanian style, using different materials to strengthen different areas of the bow and allowing it to be shorter than a longbow. For Hyrkanians, who spend most of their lives shooting from horseback, this is a necessity.\n\nIn trained hands, bows are lethal weapons that can bring down a foe from afar. A large part of the versatility of the bow comes from the arrows used in battle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51408_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow from the collection of the Priest King"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_51391_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A religious item inscribed with holy runes, this relic was wrested from the undead hands of the Priest King's shade. While very accurate, this bow fires arrows with less speed than other bows, making the arrow penetrate less armor when it hits."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_51391_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Power Draw"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_51391_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "ItemTable_51556_SecondModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow that requires great strength to draw"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In Ophir lives a pretty lass,\nWith hair of shining gold,\nher rounded breasts and supple ass,\nwould make a weak man bold.\n\nHer suitors came from all the world,\nexpectin' to be shunned,\nBut Bessie was a gen'rous girl,\nShe did them, every one!\n\nAll day and night they heard the cries,\nOf Bessie in her bed,\nAnd men were dropping off like flies,\nShe'd ridden 'em to dead.\n\nNow came the Priest of Mitra,\nAnd the girl he did beseech,\nStop with all this wickedness,\nJust listen to me preach\n\nBut Bessie was a peacemaker,\nShe didn't want to fight,\nShe acted as a horse breaker,\nAnd rode that priest all night.\n\nThe priest would not be beaten back,\nHis heart would not give way,\nThough Bessie sought to drain his sack,\nHe'd shoot throughout the day.\n\nAnd then together they each found,\nThe one that they had sought,\nIn marriage were they solemn bound,\nTogether they were caught.\n\nThe priest and girl they took their vow,\nAnd shaved their hair away,\nLet this be used to string a bow,\nAnd may it shoot all day!"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51557_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow that seems to penetrate even the thickest armor"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "There was a legend among the Nordheimers that one of the skalds was captured by a Hyperborean Witch-man. \n\nThe skald was imprisoned in the top of a Hyperborean keep, where thick icicles hung from the ceiling and the cold northern winds would cut him directly to the bone. He was going to die, so he prayed to Ymir for help.\n\nThe Skald had just given up hope, when a flash of lightning outside the tower illuminated his room - and revealed the shape of a bow trapped inside one of the icicles.\n\nChipping slowly at the icicle, the Skald uncovered the wondrous bow, and shaped himself some arrows of ice from the shards.\nThe next time his captor came to feed him, he shot an ice arrow at the Hyperborean, expecting it to shatter on his chest. Instead, it passed through the armor and directly into the creature's heart.\n\nThe Skald escaped, and the bow went with him."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51558_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A bow that fires arrows which always break"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A peasant from Koth was tired of mercenary troops riding across his fields on their way to war. He went out to confront them, with a simple bow made of a bent branch and arrows of simple twigs.\n\nThey laughed when he politely asked them to ride around his fields. One of them kicked him into the mud.\n\nHumiliated, he levelled his bow at the leader. And fired. The twig flew straight and true, striking the mercenary leader in the breastplate, right above his heart.\n\nThe twig shattered, but before the mercenaries could react, a sharp splinter flew up and lodged itself it the mercenary leader's eye.\n\nThey slaughtered the peasant, of course. But the bow somehow made it to the Exiled Lands.\n\nThis bow cannot penetrate armor at all, but it does very high damage on impact."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51559_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A legendary bow that boosts accuracy"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "When the Lemurians fled their islands, they were captured and enslaved by the mysterious race that lived on the eastern shores of the Thurian continent.\n\nA remnant of a remnant escaped that slavery and crossed the world in search of succor.\n\nThousands of people, weary and terrified, needed to be protected and fed as they crossed hostile kingdoms, ghost-haunted moors and the jungles full of dangerous creatures.\n\nA group of women, known as Dagon's Daughters, volunteered to protect the group. They were experts with the bow, and agile fighters at close range.\n\nThis bow, simply known as The Huntress, once belonged to Dagon's Daughters."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "LegitReligiousItemTable_51560_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bonus Agility"
