     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Unlike other chairs, a throne gives the one who sits in it authority above and beyond that of an ordinary man.\nBattles have always been fought for this kind of power, and they always will be.\nSitting on a throne of any kind will increase confidence and prowess for a period."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780785_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "Ancient_Civ_ItemTable3780796_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
