  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sloped rooves are practical in sandstorms as the loose debris simply runs from the roof rather than accumulating.\nAncient Civilization Wood  is one of the hardest building materials that can be created in the Exiled Lands. Weapons barely chip it and even explosive powder is not enough to weaken it in a single blow. Siege weapons or divine intervention are really the only way to bring down walls this strong.\n"
