    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A simple yet well-worn mat, woven from rough fibers and stained with the marks of countless supplications. "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "06FCAE7C47830B6997411296478511A9",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "15490BEE4619C9F6D3FB75AEB8C47D24",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "F00C9D1A4C640ABB5B6AB7ABBC1D3989",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "4F8BA961432A361F2BDA79924E54478C",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "1B3C1DF149A07FEA70E417AD279A3B18",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "37C38C0F491C8A4ECAEFF89915AA08B1",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "29AC55C0498D135148A6F18F6D4D55B3",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "4085CD654184019F0A8C5281F56B5730",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Though its craftsmanship is humble, it serves as a sacred space for those who seek communion with their gods, whether in grand temples or the solitude of the wilds. Kneeling upon it, one finds a moment of peace amidst the chaos of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ED0A15C645F81D114D0222A7ADE2F0E0",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
