     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silk Prayer Rug, Orange"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "FECC084D4286CAF677BEB799AD088660",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "12C619F4452FA37C6D372F914C27385E",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Exquisitely woven from the finest silks, this rug boasts intricate patterns and masterful craftsmanship."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "B434FC7E41DA782C4ED9DD8F06D366E2",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "C552B9944A5079B5A2504893544A322E",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "D801D6BE440E08380E5C1596C82C3E4F",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "3F9599A34992443C714F6B8C7D7B70B4",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Its rich colors and delicate embroidery speak of wealth and refinement, offering comfort to those who seek a moment of quiet reflection. Soft beneath the hands and knees, it provides a sanctuary of serenity even in the most unforgiving lands."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "0390D5FF45F432B528CB6EB8585E4BC9",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "763923AC48741CA6421EA79CD02D44AB",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Soft pelts, carefully cleaned and arranged, serve as a place of rest and reflection for the devout."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "29BABF684345CB58AC87EF9F1BFE5902",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "BD43A2FD4B0E21B37FB618BCDC8470AA",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "78687B1A425E6A9C080E0F93A653B4A4",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "85D9AC80425D0F7C9211DEADB376F3CA",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Warmer and more rugged than woven mats, these furs provide comfort even in the coldest nights of the Exiled Lands. Whether spread across stone floors or packed earth, they offer a touch of primal luxury to those who seek solace in quiet contemplation."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "73805E9D450984E29D8AB295728F5BA9",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "467C280B4AA4FDF6BCCA3FB26B2F6325",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A finely crafted drum, its taut hide and sturdy frame designed to bring rhythm and life to any gathering."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "46D6B0BA47A020B2BC516D87B0D6F390",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "22FB74ED41C3AB7DF7DD669AA5EEC870",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This well-made drum is a staple of entertainers, its deep, resonant beats capable of stirring both the soul and the body. Stretched with carefully treated hide and reinforced with a sturdy wooden frame, it is built to withstand the fervor of celebration. Whether in the hands of a skilled performer or a wandering bard, its rhythm weaves through the air, commanding dancers to move and revelers to cheer."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "8E139B804E45EB8B85F39A93F3D3A087",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A delicate flute, its melodic tones capable of enchanting any audience"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "1535AA704538D92F06D81E9FE8CB1EC9",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "F335D8AC43110FE8BB40F4A2EF393E3E",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Carved from fine wood and polished to a smooth finish, this flute is the instrument of storytellers and performers alike. Its clear, lilting notes can soothe the weary, uplift the sorrowful, or inspire dancers into a whirling frenzy. Whether played by a seasoned bard or an eager entertainer, its song lingers in the air, weaving harmony into the chaos of the Exiled Lands."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "A309345C4299877D9B725DB54B6CA69A",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A long, solid bench crafted from heavy timber, worn smooth by years of use."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "7BB3ACB2466091FE81751A8B8C981C88",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "B9A577C649A39650B93099B8B5BB0EF3",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Its unadorned design speaks of practicality, yet there is a quiet reverence in the way it stands, inviting the weary to sit, reflect, and listen. Whether in a grand hall or a humble shrine, this pew serves as a gathering place for those who seek solace in the presence of others."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "BF335F0E426CBEC2097B35BC10F75394",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silk Prayer Rug, Purple"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "AB70DAE34482899EEC571AB3F4C4A4F9",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "5CC72F87468178E1A588D5A9DAA20A39",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
