  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hoar-Frost Hatchet"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51067_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A hatchet dangerously cold to the touch"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51067_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51460_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">'I have seen the hoar-frost glittering in the sun,' she answered. 'I have heard the wind whispering across the everlasting snows.'</> - The Frost-Giant's Daughter\n\nIt is said Ymir sends these sacred tools out into the world for champions to find. With such a hatchet, one can harvest the ice of winter itself and use such material to craft garments and weapons holy to the frost giant god."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51067_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51460_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ritual Harvest"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51067_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51456_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "DT_EmberReligiousToolsTweaks_51462_ThirdModifier",
     "Path": ""
    },
