    {
     "Key": "Core_Recipes_210114_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In the Exiled Lands, among those who have managed to defend what they've built for long enough, civilization proceeds much as it does anywhere else: agriculture and game-keeping leads to wealth, and wealth leads to be recorded. Paper records become a necessity, and with them, a desk upon which to work."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
