   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102034_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5100125_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Brown stuff to serve as the \"fiber\" for your compost. "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102034_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Brown stuff includes fall (autumn) leaves; dead plants and weeds; sawdust straw; old flowers; plants that have been dryed "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102034_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dung Cake"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102035_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102141_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A cake of dry animal dung mixed with rotted plant material."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102035_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Khoroshtof, made from the by products of animal husbandry, are used as fuel. It is made by hand, traditionally from the dung of cattle."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102035_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This tree has been tapped to harvest resin"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102082_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5100117_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Resin circulates throughout a coniferous tree and a few others, and serves to seal damage to the tree."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102082_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
