  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ranch Water"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102101_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Water for plants and animals"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102101_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Habitat"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102102_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A habitat for Khitan silkworms"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Unique Habitat. The silkworm is a very specialized feeder. It eats only the Grey-Flower Lupine bushes. Because the silkworm has become domesticated so that its cocoons can be harvested to make silk fabric, it no longer lives in the wild, but depends on man-made habitats to survive."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102102_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Box Of Khitan Silkworms"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102171_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A box of enough living caterpillars to start a habitat."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102171_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Somehow a Khitan Silk trader must have found his way into the exiled lands. Judging by the blood stains on the box and journal, the author won't mind if you borrow his notes and try your hand at silk farming."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102104_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sericulture Field Manual"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The notes of an unknown exile on how to feed and care for silkworms to produce silk"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The journal outlines the steps for producing silk using Khitanese silkworms:\r\n\r\n1) Obtain silkworms and build a silkworm habitat\r\n2) Supply the habitat with Grey-flower Lupine\r\n3) Collect cocoons from the habitat\r\n4) Boil the cocoons at a stove\r\n4) Collect the raw silk\r\n5) Refine the silk into cloth at an Armorer's Bench\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Sericulture feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102106_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Silkworm Cocoon"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The silkworm completely encloses itself in a cocoon"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102106_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Boiling the Cocoon will soften it so it will be ready to be woven into silk"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102107_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grape Pulp"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102111_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Redish, purple pulp"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The grapes themselves, once cleaned and pruned of excess foliage, may be squeezed in a fluid press in order to produce pulp. While this pulp can certainly be drunk, its true value is in wine-making, where it far surpasses berries in both the quality of texture and flavor.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102111_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Grape Juice"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102112_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sweet drink made from grapes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102112_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This drink, made from squeezed grapes, is sweet to the taste and lightly cools the parched tongue."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102112_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Vintner's Journal"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The writings of an exile named Gregor Finnacus, detailing methods and best practices for growing grapes and ivy in the Exiled Lands"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "<span style=\"italic\">I know not for what reason I have been cast out of Tarantia, but it seems clear now that I will never leave this place. Wherever this place is.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">There are others here, but even from a distance I have glimpsed their savagery, so for now, I am alone. I have managed to outsmart starvation thus far and keep from the notice of marauding bands of Exiles. I think I will begin my work anew, here in this gods-forsaken place, and record my thoughts in this journal.</>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"italic\">It is not the last, great writing that I had in mind for myself. But I suppose we are not guaranteed what we want in life. Only that we will live, for a time.</>\r\n\r\n- From the Journal of Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile\r\n\r\nUsing this item will teach you the Wine Maker feat if you have not already purchased it"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102113_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The seeds for such specimens as I have managed to make flourish here, I will secure in the pages of this book. In the hopes that they will survive, if I do not.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102114_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Trellis"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102115_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Latticework used as a support for climbing plants"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The trellis, though a simple feat of carpentry, makes for the ideal growing space for ivy. Allowing them to grasp sustenance from the earth, it then gives them an upward surface upon which to reach for the sun's rays.     - Gregor Finnacus, the Vintner in Exile"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102115_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Water Barrel"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102128_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102128_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A wooden barrel for storing water"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102128_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102128_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dry Roasted Coffee Beans"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102130_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Roasting gives coffee its unique flavors and aromas"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102130_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102130_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Coffee Grounds"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102131_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "By grinding the coffee beans you help the water to extract efficiently the solubles that are responsible for the taste and aroma in coffee"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102131_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102131_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Hot Coffee"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102132_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This dark delicious liquid has a robust, full bodied bold and smoky taste"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102132_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102132_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Iced Coffee"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102133_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Coffee made in the normal way and then served over ice or in cold milk"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102133_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_recipetablerow_5102133_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Planter, Wall Hanging "
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102134_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "dt_Horti_ItemTableRow_5102137_Name",
     "Path": ""
