  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "These jinxed book piles are just perfect to showcase how knowledgeable you are, they also work quite well as a makeshift ladder, and they do wonders at keeping pesky bosses away from your lab, for fear of catastrophic book collapse. On second thought, perhaps a skilled scientist could use such precarious book piles as a way to incapacitate and immobilize said dancer bosses for collection of biological samples. Either way, stack with care! What book were you looking for again...?"
   },
