  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "They say that Jayce Bjornson's  skill at craftsmanship was blessed by the gods themselves as they crafted his hands in their own imagine, gifting him with godly skills. But anyone who really ever knew this known Viking, know that his greatest gift has always been his heart made out of gold."
   },
