     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A trinket that self-inflicts Blight when taking or dealing damage, and grants power when Blight Rot occurs"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "05CEFDB74032015CBC3F0AB87A258439",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "FE1C68E642A468E5AC3938ADA82D66F1",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "When a foreign disease ravaged his people, he refused to forsake even one of them in their time of need. As is the fate of any good deed, the king soon found himself afflicted with the same malady. When the source of the otherworldly affliction became known, the heroic monarch marched fearlessly alone unto the darkness, prepared to offer his enemies a fury akin only to the compassion he held for his subjects."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "C11EFFDF414226318758AD890A93D23D",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
