  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rimecaller Icestaff"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "17B7367C469957BE6F00C7B02867749C",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "950A7363499511C674E0BB9593C46149",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"The Gnome, Nyxie Hexgleam forged this staff during the earliest days of her pact with the Undead Patron, seeking a reliable font of power to fuel her growing abilities. As her obsession with forbidden magic deepened and her mind succumbed to madness, she subjected the staff to countless dark rituals, twisting and corrupting its very essence. What had once been a simple conduit for her magic became a malevolent relic.\" Commissioned by Fleur."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "272985DE462EE84D06B6469E43F9182C",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
