  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A ceremonial mace wielded by wicked warriors, the Pyremace is said to burn away a sliver of the wielder’s soul with every accursed impact against the foes that stand in their way.  Regardless of the validity of these claims, those that take up this weapon almost universally meet violent ends. Commissioned by Lunar Serpent."
   },
