   "Source": {
    "Text": "A serrated greatsword originally used in demonic rituals.  It is said that each time this intensely heavy blade rends flesh, its wielder finds themselves invigorated as if the blade demands more.  Regardless of the validity of these claims, those that take up this weapon almost universally meet violent ends. Commissioned by Lunar Serpent."
   },
