  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The greatsword is a weapon used to cut, cleave, and crush mountains of enemies, but at the cost of a defensive option such as a shield. Perhaps fools choose the weapon class, or, perhaps an even scarier thought, it's wielders have no need for protection."
   },
