  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "(HA) Full Heal Extract"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490780_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Instantly and fully heals those who drink it"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490780_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Stygian traditions of healing hold that the aloe plant contains many desirable properties. In Luxur, the aloe is harvested for use in the temples of Derketo to cleanse blemishes from the skin of the priestesses. It is often used to sooth oozing wounds and those who ingest it claim that they feel a burst of wellbeing. Whether these effects are of the body or the mind is irrelevant - ingesting aloe extract seems to give the imbiber a regenerative health effect."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2490780_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491338_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491339_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491340_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
