  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Frozen Moonlight Blade"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491355_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491766_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A weaponized fragment of the moon's pale light"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491355_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492355_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492364_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In the earliest days of sorcerous discovery, those who pursued its secrets looked to the world around them for answers. In the sun, they found warmth and radiance - seeing the moon as its opposite, few dared even considering it a source of power. However, man's folly remained as constant as the moon itself, and despite the presumed risks, there were those who still yearned for whatever power they might find. This blade, forged of moonlight made corporeal, was one of the earliest known results of that research. The weapon is both impossibly lightweight and just as fragile, and it served as a potent magic artifact even in the hands of those foreign to the arcane arts. Consequently, people began to see the potential for sorcery as a weapon, not just a simple tool. Hostilities between magic practitioners grew until the practice became outlawed in its entirety, and those who dared indulge in it were exiled."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491355_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492355_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492364_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
