     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "There is an otherwordly stench of death and decay that wafts from the blade, and no matter how much one might try and clean or shine it, the ruinous weapon retains its battered and broken form. No doubt a myriad of souls have been claimed by this weapon, and while wielding it, you get the sense you can add many more to that number."
