  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Explosives have become a staple in the destruction of man's grand architecture - and these jars have proven time and time again a key component in transporting the volatile powder contained within. Deals significantly more damage than a regular Explosive Jar, but has a shorter placement range and can only be detonated by interacting with the fuse or another explosion."
   },
