  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one handed slashing blade imbued with Frostburn & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491780_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Crafted from a piece of \"Nightsky\", this blade was once wielded by a long-lost planar travelling civilisation. They used weapons like these in their fight against Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. The material is rumoured to both cut and protect from the Madness caused by said Horrors. One of those famed weapons has found itself in the possession of the Archivist of Elsewhere. Up until this day, the blade's material reminds everyone, that it once was possible to temper the nights starry sky into a solid material. Commissioned by Baldur."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491780_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
