    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed maul imbued with Slowness & Charged Finishers"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491821_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491543_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"This hammer, featuring a twisted purple handle and golden adornments, is blessed by the priests of the Luminary High Order to grant extra strength in the pursuit of justice. Thanks to this blessing, the hammer's impact strikes with the force of thunder, followed by the kiss of lightning. Each hammer is custom-etched with unique designs that commemorate the individual efforts of its wielder in the ways of Aeloria and is forged by Master Blacksmiths from the Holy See.\" Commissioned by Sentique."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491821_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Nightsky Halberd"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491822_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491544_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed halberd imbued with Energizing Assault & Frostburn"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491822_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A long axe-like Halberd made from Nightsky - a mysterious material said to both protect against and hurt Eldritch and Cosmic Horrors. Who or what used Nightsky to brandish such a weapon, is unknown.Up until this day, the blade's material reminds everyone, that it once was possible to temper the nights starry sky into a solid material. Commissioned by Baldraz."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491822_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
