    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Butcher's Tenderizer Battleaxe"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491961_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491568_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe that inflicts Curse"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491961_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This large knife was found next to an old barrel oozing blood and rotted flesh. The weapon sat for a long time, untouched, and marred by both rust and use. Commissioned by SmurfCat1."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491961_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Butcher's Handaxe"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491962_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491569_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe that can be thrown, and inflicts with Curse"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491962_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A rusted cleaver that has seen many decades of use and will see many decades more. Commissioned by SmurfCat1."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491962_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dagger Striker"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491964_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491570_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Offhand stunning weapon, infused with Brood Poison & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491964_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491570_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Once favored by the master fencers of the royal court, these daggers were as much a symbol of status as a practical tool in combat. Legends tell of a fabled parrying dagger that could block even the mightiest of blows, forged in the fires of a forgotten age. Commissioned by Asher."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491964_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "King of Survival Rapier"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491965_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491571_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one handed rapier, imbued with Brood Poison & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491965_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A king once wanted a body to ascend beyond mortal chances of survival, and this rapier is made from the very tail of that body once he learned survival was not something easily done alone. The tip of the blade seems to siphon life at a touch. Commission item."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491965_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Purple Dragon Quarterstaff"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491966_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491572_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two handed, lightweight staff imbued with Empowering Assault & Forgeflame"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491966_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This quarterstaff, made by infusion of Purple Dragon Plasma and dense metals, has the capability to sear away armor while resisting  heat. Some say it has a name in an ancient dialect of Draconic, though none can read it. Commission item."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491966_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Bladed Rifle"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491967_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491573_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Rip and tear until it is done. Commissioned by Kais."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491967_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ebonveil Infernal Warspear"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491968_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491574_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed leaping warspear imbued with Energizing Assault & Cursed Strikes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491968_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"A Cursed spear forged by the People of Ebonveil for their King and Queen. Made with a Cursed Metal to strike down Celestial kind. Still adorned with the golden blood of the fallen.\" Commissioned by kingragnar - Lish."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491968_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mayumi's Katana"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491969_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491577_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Two handed relic katana imbued with Heavy Bleed & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491969_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This is the blade wielded by the renown warrior Mayumi, it has been enchanted and sharped to a deadly edge. It is said to be made of a unknown metal that makes it far more durable and light. Commissioned by Raya."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491969_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mayumi's Noblesword"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491970_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491575_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed lightweight blade, imbued with Heavy Bleed & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491970_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This was the secondary sword of Mayumi, similar in make to her primary Katana. Both blades were almost always worn by her. The Wakizashi was a smaller and more agile blade used for more close quarters and two weapon fighting in rare cases. Commissioned by Raya."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491970_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Mayumi's Pairblades"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491971_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491576_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Destrous matched blades, imbued with Heavy Bleed & Healing Attacks"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491971_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "These two blades are that of the renowned warrior Mayumi's, her Katana and Wakizashi used together for a deadly yet artful style. Commission by Raya."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491971_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Jotunn's Redeemer Battleaxe"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491972_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491578_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe imbued with Frostburn & Empowering Assault"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491972_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A Battleaxe of Northman make seemingly meant for the hands of a Jotunn.The blade is cold to the touch thanks to the effects of the glowing runes etched into the blade. Commissioned by SkyTheGuy."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491972_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dual Berserker's Axes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491973_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491579_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Paired axes, imbued with Withering Strikes & Healing Finishers"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491973_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "These paired axes are said to be favored by the most fierce of Northern Warriors, the Berserkr. Known for their sheer relentlessness in battle each strike landed from these axes seem to rejuvenate the wielder so they may continue their assault. Commissioned by SkyTheGuy."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491973_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Twinned Nych'teran Inquisitor's Gunblades"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491974_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491581_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Matching gunblade swords, unloaded, but just as sharp. Imbued with Cursed Strikes & Energizing Assault"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491974_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "While most members of the Nych'teran inquisition choose more elegant or magically-inclined weapons, some have taken to a more... explosive approach. Crafted by the master smiths of House Malleolus, these weapons were designed specifically for those select few who either find themselves incapable of sorcery, or simply trust the speed and lethality of a bullet over that of a hasty incantation. Such beliefs often set these particular inquisitors at odds with their higher ups, though few can argue with their results, and fewer still dare to challenge the bullet coming for their hearts. Commissioned by Harbinger72, lore credit to Ashborn Legacy & Rickets."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491974_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Aetherblade Longsword"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491975_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491580_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A well balanced longsword, imbued with Healing Attacks & Cursed Strikes."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491975_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Lightweight yet unyielding slices through the air with effortless grace leaving a faint luminous trail in its wake. Perfectly balanced it feels as much a conduit for energy as it does a weapon resonating with the strength and will of its wielder. Commissioned by Nova."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491975_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Noblesword of the Revenant"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491976_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491590_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A noblesword with an almost palpable hunger; it seems to cut through armor like rotting cloth to cleave the flesh and bone beneath. Commission item."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491976_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Eluskan Sword"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2491977_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491583_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
