   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"I didn't choose to wear the armour and carry the sword, nor was I asked. I was born and raised to be the last line of defense for someone whose life is more important than mine. If I fail in my task, death would be a merciful punishment.\" Commissioned by ElftasticNicky."
