     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "An unholy two-handed reaper, with a hunger for souls"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492002_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A heretical weapon forged in a cold flame and baptized by the life essence of a devil. Do not be fooled by its regal appearence; for it serves a singular, wretched purpose: The severance of soul from body."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492002_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Ascendant Core"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492003_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2493139_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A celestial material, and a key component in creating Highmane's equipment"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492003_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2493139_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "What was once the lost art of trapping raw, natural power within an object has now been reclaimed thanks to the knowledge of the Highmanes. This core eminates a different kind of power; the fusion of both the natural world and life itself. Trapped forever in a battle of harmony and discord, the raw potential of this object is near unmatched."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492003_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Sinner's Knife"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492004_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491604_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one-handed haunted blade, enhancing its wielder's murders"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492004_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Thousands of years and just as many lives have crossed this blade, and yet, if a weapon could feel unsatisfied - this one would be."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492004_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Abyssal Eastblade"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492005_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491605_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed katana, marked by the unending Abyss"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492005_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A historic blade, first wielded by one who gazed into the endless Abyss and found a fragment of its power. The unnatural edge passes through skin, bone, and metal as if they were no more than an inconvenice, but the glimpses and whispers of the void that the blade offers threaten to drive even the wisest mad."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492005_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Fatebinder's Longsword"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492006_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491606_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A one-handed longsword, forged in the flames of Chaos"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492006_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The threads of fate are carefully woven for all living beings when they are brought into this world. Each and every moment, all triumphs and misfortunes, are but chapters in a story. This blade serves as a way to change their endings."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492006_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
