     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A fabled blade, said to have been wielded by an awe-inspiring hero in the days of old. At the mercy of the giants, most of mankind faced the question of slavery or death. Forged in secrecy by highborn mages and lowborn smiths alike, it was used to deliver an answer their captors would not soon forget. If the legends are to be believed, the forgotten hero still lives; for death has not yet earned them."
   },
   "Keys": [
