    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491669_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A surprisingly light two handed hammer that seems to be made partially of enchanted ice. This weapon was left abandoned in the ruins of a nameless northen village for generations until it was recovered by one of its long since Exiled daughters. Much like her, it had been broken and abandoned until it was enchanted and given a second chance at life. It is rumored to serve House Arxan, a faint hum from the crystal at its base seems to indicate a longing to be returned home. To this end, the very weapon itself seems to rejuvenate the wielder in hopes of never being left on the field of battle again. Commissioned by OblivionCross."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492131_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "(HA) Arcane Forged Ultra Greatsword"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492132_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A massive two handed sword imbued with Plagued Strikes & Frostburn"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492132_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This massive sword was forged with raw arcane energies and various magical stones. It simply does not just cut and slash. The unpredictability of the magical element can cause different wounds to apply. Commissioned by ChileProducts."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492132_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
