  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "\"Forged in the shadow of forgotten rituals, its edge whispers of stolen souls. Each swing leaves a chilling void, a reminder of the life it devoured, leaving the air thick with despair.\" Commissioned by DayDreaming."
