    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A pair of northern swords made in the Nordic style, hardened steel with carefully crafted leather wrapping the grip, used by reavers who stalk the shores in search of food, thralls and gold. Commissioned by Ram."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
