     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Chilling Battleaxe"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492155_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491679_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed axe imbued with Healing Attacks & Plagued Strikes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492155_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491679_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The battleaxe, encrusted with frost, bites deep, chilling the target to the bone.  Each strike eats at the targets life force, inflicting them with a plague unmatched. Commissioned by DayDreaming."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492155_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "(HA) Invisible Shield"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492156_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A shield"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492156_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Great General's Battleaxe"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492157_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491680_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed splitter, once carried by the hero betrayed"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492157_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "In a far-forgotten kingdom that chose to reward the greatest of its heroes with torture and execution, it should have come as little surprise when one chose not to give in so willingly to their punishment undeserved. As monumental a fall from grace as they come, the Fallen Hero tore the world he had once helped to save asunder, sparing none - for they had all stood by and watched as the knife was driven into his back, and they were no less deserving of his wrath than those that did this to him. Before he could bring about all things, the Great General, although just as wronged as the Fallen Hero, chose to stand against him. Putting an end to the threat and his closest friend, he secured the future of all livings things - but the battle left its mark on this world, just as it did the General's soul."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492157_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Evergrasp Throwing Shortspear"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492158_Name",
     "Path": ""
    },
    {
     "Key": "HA_RecipeTable_New_2491681_RecipeName",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A two-handed javelin, slowly being consumed"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492158_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The never-ending void does not have an individual to represent it as its ruler; instead, it is governed by the concept that challenges all others: Chaos. It leaves its mark on everything it touches, and this spear is no exception. Long ago, it served the valiant purpose of fighting against abyssal nightmares, but now it remains as a warning. Chaos cannot be bested, and one distant day, it will consume everything."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492158_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Chaotic"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492158_FourthModifier",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "(HA) Essence of Chaos Modkit"
   },
