     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A cursed two-handed maul imbued with Empowering Afflictions & Decaying Strikes"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492163_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "The forgemaster responsible for this abomination was sacrificed to his own creation by the monster that commissioned it. The spite from the blacksmith can be felt at all times while wielding it. Commissioned by JackBright."
   },
   "Keys": [
