     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "(HA) Blooming & Withered Rose Pairblades"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492165_Name",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Dextrous matched blades, imbued with Lacerating Strikes & Empowering Assault"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492165_ShortDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A pair of blades thought lost to time, the very essence of the metal they're forged with breathes life and death. Those with an understanding of soul magic may feel a warmth of kindness as if a protective soul is embedded within the Blooming Rose, and a more cold, and foreboding dread, as if one may feel the sense of command and control emanating from within the Withered Rose. Two opposite, yet linked forces keep the two blades together, as if the souls of those who have long passed on from this world have blessed the pairblades. Commissioned by Alice."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492165_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
