  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "A spear most legendary among giants, rumored to have been held and used in battle against the Fey by the legendary being, Titan, himself. Passed down for generations within the House of Nan after the death of such a legendary being, it ended up being stolen before returning as a mere heap of fragments. Many replicas were made, with pieces of the original dwarven-forged weapon hammered into them, giving each a fraction of its capabilities, although nothing quite like the original. Its long blade cuts through even the hardest blends of dwarven metal alloys, maiming anything in its path. Legends say that the longer one swings it, the more invigorated the wielder feels. Commissioned by silexa."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "HA_ItemTable_2492333_LongDesc",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
