  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "Potion can be used with Level X or higher\nOn use, you get Fame Letter\n(These values can be adjusted by Admins in the Admin settings)\n\nThis is the EAA Fame menu.\nWhen you press \"Increase Fame\",\nyou will get a Fame Potion. \nOn use you will be reset to Level 5,\nbut you will recive a \"Fame Letter\" as Reward.\n\nWith this Letter, you go to the \"Legendary Vendor\"\n\nThere you can purchase a \"Star of the habit\" for that Letter.\n\nWith that \"Star\" you can buy items in the Fameshop.\n\nMake sure you have the Feat in the Religion-Tab, called\n\"Star of the habit\".\n\nIf you dont see the Feat there, your admins have blocked it.\n\nA \"Increase Fame\" is available if you have Level X, by default 60\n\nHappy Level-Hunt!"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "2C1956DB49E376883FD8F7A596BA688E",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "This cant be un-done. Are you sure?\r\nYou will learn all vanilla sorcery feats"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "BDDAEE7245D810ED9724A0BED5B3B2EC",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You will join the Stonemason Profession. \nYou will get access to a high quality Tool of your Profession.\nAlso you will grant access to diffrent Recipes.\n\nKeep in mind, the way to switch a Profession is very expensive.\nSo make your choice wisely."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "4857608A48047AB960052AA24C7221C8",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You will join the Lumberjack Profession. \nYou will get access to a high quality Tool of your Profession.\nAlso you will grant access to diffrent Recipes.\n\nKeep in mind, the way to switch a Profession is very expensive.\nSo make your choice wisely."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "40963B3C4C323160103FF181CDD0C5ED",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You will join the Butcher Profession. \nYou will get access to a high quality Tool of your Profession.\nAlso you will grant access to diffrent Recipes.\n\nKeep in mind, the way to switch a Profession is very expensive.\nSo make your choice wisely."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "ECC482DF45021A7862CDF59F118CE747",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You will join the Herbalist Profession. \nYou will get access to a high quality Tool of your Profession.\nAlso you will grant access to diffrent Recipes.\n\nKeep in mind, the way to switch a Profession is very expensive.\nSo make your choice wisely."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "8B7D5B464046ACFB586345ADA045EE8E",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You will join the Tanner Profession. \nYou will get access to a high quality Tool of your Profession.\nAlso you will grant access to diffrent Recipes.\n\nKeep in mind, the way to switch a Profession is very expensive.\nSo make your choice wisely."
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "44E5334E4D05A5212D89FA98A961ED87",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "Source": {
    "Text": "You have learned the EAA Basic Feat. \nKeep in mind, that it doesnt make sense to press this button again. The Basic Feat is not removable, except from admins.\n\nSo if you have issues to open the Class Menu, make sure that you gave your server enough time to load all feats. (Yes, that process can take a long time)\n\nA good \"self-check\" is by opening your inventory crafting, if you have all normal recipes in your inventory crafting, like vanilla dlc stuff - you should be good to go. Anyway, i hope that helps!"
   },
   "Keys": [
    {
     "Key": "7EB5F605475EF59466B0A6BDC5EDB96A",
     "Path": ""
    }
   ]
